"""Generate reviewable target DDL. Domain services/guards are phased separately."""
from pathlib import Path
out=['-- Target domain baseline. Structure is not proof of implemented workflows.\nBEGIN;']
names=[]
def table(name, fields='', refs=None, constraints=None, source=False):
    names.append(name)
    cols=['id uuid PRIMARY KEY DEFAULT gen_random_uuid()', 'company_id uuid NOT NULL REFERENCES companies(id)', 'created_by uuid NOT NULL REFERENCES users(id)', 'created_at timestamptz NOT NULL DEFAULT now()', 'UNIQUE(company_id,id)']
    if source:
        cols += ['source_id uuid NOT NULL', 'UNIQUE(company_id,source_id)', 'FOREIGN KEY(company_id,source_id) REFERENCES source_documents(company_id,id)']
    if fields: cols += [fields]
    for col,target,nullable in (refs or []):
        cols += [f'{col} uuid'+('' if nullable else ' NOT NULL'), f'FOREIGN KEY(company_id,{col}) REFERENCES {target}(company_id,id)']
    cols += constraints or []
    out.append(f'CREATE TABLE {name}(\n '+',\n '.join(cols)+'\n);')

